# Database files

SSOT and immutability: `.cursor/rules/backend.mdc`. This file is only adapter/factory paths.

```typescript
const { activeDatabase } = useAppData();
import { DatabaseService } from '@/database/database.service';
```

- Types: `ClassroomDatabase` in `src/database/types.ts` (or `src/types/models.ts`)
- IndexedDB: `src/database/storage/indexed-db.storage.ts`
- Tauri: `src/database/storage/tauri-fs.storage.ts` (`classrooms/*.json` + `index.json`)
- Factory: `src/database/database.factory.ts`
